<title>THAILAND: Thai baht hits record low of 32.90/33.10 offshore.</title>
<headline>Thai baht hits record low of 32.90/33.10 offshore.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai baht hit a</p>
<p>record low of 32.900/33.100 to the dollar in the offshore market on Tuesday in line with sustained weakness of regional currencies.</p>
<p>The baht's previous offshore low was 32.900/33.000 in mid-July. The currency was quoted at 32.550/32.650 to the dollar in the domestic market, sharply weaker than its 32.05/32.15 level near the Monday close.</p>
</text>
